  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Financial Management in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this grant is to improve financial management (FM) in the Bhutanese public and private sectors through assisting implementation of international financial reporting standards under a Standards Board and strengthening internal audit and public accounting functions in the Ministry of Finance (MoF) and the Dzongkhag (district).  This IDF grant (the Grant) is the third in a series and follows up on a series of diagnostics which have led the Royal Government of Bhutan (RGoB) to prepare a PFM action matrixReform Plan which the Grant will help to implement.</narrative>
  </description>
